  <h2 class="sec">The path from agreement to action.</h2>
  <div class="scope">
    <div>
      <h3>Support</h3>
      <p>Free, for anyone who thinks living costs too much: join, share sourced material, sign the pledge. This is the public demand that makes the rest possible.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Contribute</h3>
